    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's an interesting mix. But some people in the community are saying that any system that isn't a pure lottery is inherently unfair because it picks \"winners\" based on subjective government criteria. Why is a mixed model actually more equitable than just a straight lottery?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
